  "description": "A mass-spring system exhibiting simple harmonic motion. The position oscillates sinusoidally due to the elastic restoring force proportional to displacement. Reference: Strogatz, S. H. (2015). Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos. Westview Press. Source: https://doi.org/10.1201/9780429492563",
